Local Installation
bash
git clone https://github.com/akentay/medbook-mongo2.git
cd medbook-mongo2
npm install
Create .env and run:

bash
npm start
Then open:

arduino
http://localhost:3000
Deployment Notes (Render)
Production requires:

Working MongoDB Atlas connection
Environment variables configured
Server must use process.env.PORT
No Postman required for defense


